    {
      "id": "va_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -334
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Variations & presets\n\nA flow field of strokes: Perlin noise turns each one, a seeded random stretches it. Both draw from the patch seed.\n\n• Vary (toolbar, Ctrl/⌘+Shift+R) re-rolls the seed: same patch, a new picture.\n• Presets panel: recall Calm or Storm, or drag Morph between them; Save keeps the sliders and seed you like.",
        "width": 430,
        "height": 270
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Variations & presets\n\nA flow field of strokes: Perlin noise turns each one, a seeded random stretches it. Both draw from the patch seed.\n\n• Vary (toolbar, Ctrl/⌘+Shift+R) re-rolls the seed: same patch, a new picture.\n• Presets panel: recall Calm or Storm, or drag Morph between them; Save keeps the sliders and seed you like.",
        "width": 430,
        "height": 270
      }
    },
